# Domain canonicalization (www -> non-www)
https://www.aiagecalc.com/*  https://aiagecalc.com/:splat  301!
http://www.aiagecalc.com/*   https://aiagecalc.com/:splat  301!
http://aiagecalc.com/*       https://aiagecalc.com/:splat  301!

# Redirect old celebrity URLs to new people URLs (301 Permanent)
/celebrity/:slug         /people/:slug  301
/famous-birthdays/:slug  /people/:slug  301

# NOTE: No `/* /index.html 200` catch-all on purpose.
# Every indexable route is prerendered to its own static file (200). Any path with
# no matching file falls through to dist/404.html, which Cloudflare Pages serves
# with a real 404 status — the SPA still boots from it and renders the NotFound UI.
# This avoids soft-404s (previously every unknown URL returned 200 + "not found").
